  "details": "VRChat Version: 1249\n\n\nDescription of the bug: I think this is more of an oversight than a bug, but when you play VRchat with a controller in VR, it shows the old cursor and the old cursor renders behind the UI, making it difficult to select things. This also happens on the Oculus Quest when playing with a bluetooth controller.\n\n\nSteps to reproduce (how did you encounter the bug?): Play VRchat with an xbox controller, or any normal controller in VR. This also happens on the Quest.\n\n\nAny extra files? (output logs, screenshots): Screenshots included",
